{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_54716","headline":"兵要望江南 占日第十一（京本列第六○五十六首） 五十四 · 易静","name":"兵要望江南 占日第十一（京本列第六○五十六首） 五十四","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"日四耳，顶上即爲冠。\n两下爲缨须尽日，下爲履象不爲权，回报日须端。\n（经曰：「日上爲冠，下爲履，两下爲耳，长而爲缨，朝抱日吉。\n」）。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"易静","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_54716.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_54716","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"古风","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}